# Build context of deploy/server/Dockerfile and deploy/scanner/Dockerfile (the repository root).
# Everything a build produces or a developer keeps locally stays out, so the images never carry a
# local secret (.env) and the layer cache only changes when sources do.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/.tmp
/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.superpowers
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
deploy/.env
.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store
# A licence signing key never enters a build context (.gitignore has the same).
**/*.private.pem
